‫"since you came along." ♪

210
00:15:58.541 --> 00:16:02.833
‫♪ "I've finally
‫learned how to live." ♪

211
00:16:02.958 --> 00:16:08.250
‫♪ "I cannot live... live
‫when you're gone." ♪

212
00:16:08.375 --> 00:16:13.625
‫♪ "I cannot live... live
