‫♪ "Swear on the Lord..." ♪

1643
01:49:57.621 --> 01:50:03.285
‫♪ "Never let these
‫eyes be moist again." ♪

1644
01:50:03.365 --> 01:50:08.955
‫♪ "I am ready to
‫face any challenge." ♪

1645
